As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, amounts owed to officers and directors, or to companies owned by officers and directors, of the Company for services and expenses totalled $17,500 and $600,000, respectively. These amounts owing have been included in accounts payable and accrued liabilities.

During the year ended December 31, 2025, the Company incurred $383,748 to our Asset Manager, a company controlled by the current chairman of the board of the Company. As of December 31, 2025, these fees were paid in full.
